   1:Source/core/storage.c **** /*
   2:Source/core/storage.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — storage.c
   3:Source/core/storage.c ****  * Persistent storage (port of Source/core/storage.lua). See storage.h.
   4:Source/core/storage.c ****  * Datastore is Lua-only, so persistence is a custom sectioned text file
   5:Source/core/storage.c ****  * written through pd->file with the exact same observable semantics:
   6:Source/core/storage.c ****  * defaults on first load (and save), history dedupe-to-top with 50 cap,
   7:Source/core/storage.c ****  * bookmark dedupe→title-update, remove-by-index, save after every mutation.
   8:Source/core/storage.c ****  */
